OL,3,CEnzo Fernandez set for City move for
OL,4,Cequalling #125m British record
OL,6,FManchester City have agreed to sign
OL,7,FEnzo Fernandez from Chelsea for a
OL,8,Fjoint-British record fee of
OL,9,F#125million, it is understood.
OL,11,FIt comes more than three months after
OL,12,Fthe Argentina international first told
OL,13,FChelsea he wanted to leave and more
OL,14,Fthan two weeks after the expiry of a
OL,15,Fdeadline imposed by the club for bids.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/3
