OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1788626898
OL,3,CEnzo Fernandez set for City move for
OL,4,Cequalling #125m British record
OL,6,FBut, it is understood the club were
OL,7,Falways open to doing a deal beyond the
OL,8,F13 August cut-off, provided City's
OL,9,Foffer reflected rising summer market
OL,10,Fvaluations after a number of deals in
OL,11,Fthe Premier League and in Europe that
OL,12,Fwere struck for more than #100m.
OL,14,FThe size of the fee matches that paid
OL,15,Fby Liverpool to Newcastle for
OL,16,FAlexander Isak in September 2025.
OL,18,FThe move will reunite the 25-year-old
OL,19,Fwith City boss Enzo Maresca, with whom
OL,20,Fhe worked when the Italian was in
OL,21,Fcharge at Stamford Bridge.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/3
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
