FL,363,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1788626898
OL,3,CEnzo Fernandez set for City move for
OL,4,Cequalling #125m British record
OL,6,FThe pair enjoyed a close relationship
OL,7,Fand Fernandez has been eager to work
OL,8,Funder Maresca again.
OL,10,FFormal contact was made by City over a
OL,11,Fdeal on Monday, 31 August, evening and
OL,12,Fthings moved quickly on deadline day.
OL,14,FFernandez was left out of the last two
OL,15,Fmatchday squads by Chelsea boss Xabi
OL,16,FAlonso, who said he only wanted
OL,17,Fplayers who had a "desire to play" for
OL,18,Fthe club.
